text:Queue a sentence: /vaken-pause steer queue <sentence>, or /vaken-pause steer queue @2 <sentence> for another session. When that session is quiet, the sentence shows dim in its prompt box. Its owner presses Tab to take it. Nothing is sent by itself. | text twin (the plain answer of a slash command), English by rule (core/lang.ts)
text:To send a message into another session: /vaken-pause steer send @2 <sentence>. Vaken asks you first. | text twin (the plain answer of a slash command), English by rule (core/lang.ts)
